<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank sets repo rate at flat 4.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank sets repo rate at flat 4.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, set its key repurchase rate at an unchanged fixed 4.10 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No rate change was expected by the market.</p>
<p>The central bank's deposit rate stands at 3.75 percent and its lending rate, 5.25 percent.</p>
<p>The rate has been unchanged since December 17.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
